            "anchor": "release-3-2-changed-breaking-for-consumers-layout",
            "markdown": "- Code that switches exhaustively over `ISdSidebarConfiguration['version']` no longer compiles until it handles Sidebar V4:\n\n  ```diff\n   switch (sidebar.version) {\n     case 3:\n       return renderV3(sidebar);\n  +  case 4:\n  +    return renderV4(sidebar); // SidebarConfigurationV4\n   }\n  ```",
