                    "text": "The dot is an `sd-badge type=\"dot\"` on the lower-right edge: diameter `clamp(8px, size × 0.25, 20px)`, a 2px ring (3px from size 64) in the new component token `--sd-avatar-status-ring` (`var(--sd-surface)` in light and dark), centred on the edge at 45°. `statusLabel` is the dot's tooltip and is appended to the accessible name; a dev-mode warning says when `status` has no `statusLabel`. New input `name`: the accessible name and, for an image avatar, the tooltip; a failed image now takes its initials and colour from `name` when it is set. `sd-badge` gains the hook `--sd-badge-dot-size` for the diameter of its dot.",
