            "key": "form-generic",
            "title": "Form generic",
            "level": 4,
            "anchor": "release-3-2-changed-form-generic",
            "markdown": "- Pages accept an optional plain-text `description`, edited in the page panel and shown above the page fields in every navigation mode (also the `aria-describedby` of the page region with tabs/steps).",
