            "key": "i18n",
            "title": "i18n",
            "level": 4,
            "anchor": "release-3-0-changed-breaking-for-consumers-i18n",
            "markdown": "- New catalog keys `core.notify.close`, `core.form.select.clear`, `core.component.table.export-max-exceeded`, `core.component.preview-video.error`, `.retry`, `.download` and `.unsupported`. A custom typed `I18nCatalog` must add them.\n- 217 new catalog keys — `core.component.form-builder.*` (210), `core.component.form-generic.validator.{integer,precision,number}`, `core.component.form-generic.validation.{unregistered,failed}`, `core.form.input.minlength` and `core.form.textarea.minlength` — and 54 `core.component.form-builder.*` keys of the previous builder removed.\n  - A custom typed `I18nCatalog` must add and drop them.",
