            "markdown": "- Add default Lucide aliases for `broken_image`, `crop`, `flip`, `lock_open`, `photo_size_select_large`, `redo`, `rotate_left`, `tune`, `undo` and `zoom_out` (and the matching Material aliases).\n- Tile shape (`@sdcorejs/angular/modules/icon`): new type `SdIconShape = 'square' | 'circle' | 'none'` for the decorative icon tile of `<sd-section>` (header), `<sd-inform>`, `<sd-data-state>`, `SdNotifyService` toasts and `SdConfirmService` dialogs.\n  - Set it per instance with the `iconShape` input (`sd-section`, `sd-inform`, `sd-data-state`) or the `iconShape` option (`success`/`info`/`warning`/`error`, and all six confirm methods), or app-wide with `provideSdIcon({ defaultShape })`; the instance value wins. `none` drops the background but keeps the tile size. Each tile carries `data-icon-shape`, and the CSS custom property `--sd-icon-shape-radius` (default `var(--sd-radius-8, 8px)`) sets the square radius.",
