            "key": "query-builder",
            "title": "Query builder",
            "level": 4,
            "anchor": "release-2-0-fixed-query-builder",
            "markdown": "- **A live OOM reproduction** in `query-builder` — `[items]=\"field.values || []\"` allocated a fresh array every change-detection pass and `sd-select`'s `toObservable(items)` loop froze the page.\n  - Fixed, along with the same allocation shape in query-bar, table, org-chart and tab-router.",
